      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "30",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 30:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa yaakoba Abaisiraeli ati: “Mpegaano mbaghaire okulondagho ku bintu bino ebibiri: okugheebwa enkabi oba okusindikirwa ebikolimo. Ebintu ebyo bwe birimala okubatuukaku nga muli eyo mu maghanga agandi, Musengwa Katonda waimwe y'alibasansaaniza, muliidhukiranga nga nabagha okulondagho ku ebyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.30.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.30.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 30:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Imwe n'abaidhukulu abaliiragho, bwe munaakyukanga ni mwira eri Musengwa Katonda waimwe, era ni mugonderanga ebiragiro bye, bye ndi kubagha olwaleero, n'omutima gwaimwe gwonagwona era n'omwoyo gwaimwe gwonagwona, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.30.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.30.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 30:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musengwa Katonda waimwe aidha kubagemerwanga ekivunika. Aidha kubasolozanga eyo mu maghanga goonagoona y'anaabasansaanizanga, abaize mwiremu okuba obukalamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.30.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.30.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 30:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni bwe muliba nga musansaaniire mu nsonda dh'ensi edh'eghala, Musengwa Katonda waimwe alibasolozaayo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.30.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.30.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 30:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "yaabata mu nsi eyagheebwa badhaadha baimwe, olwo imwe mugitwale. Era yaabaleetera okuba n'ebirungi kamaala, n'okuba abangi okusinga badhaadha baimwe bwe baali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.30.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.30.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 30:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musengwa Katonda waimwe alireetera emyoyo gyaimwe n'egya baidhukulu baimwe abaliiragho okuba emigonvu, mwamugonza n'omutima gwaimwe gwonagwona era n'omwoyo gwaimwe gwonagwona, memale mwaba abalamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.30.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.30.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 30:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alisindika ebikolimo ebyo byonabyona ku bazigu baimwe abaabakyaghanga era abaabakiriganga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.30.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.30.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 30:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Era muliiramu kabiri okugonderanga Musengwa Katonda, n'okutuukirizanga ebiragiro bye, bye ndi kubagha olwaleero.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.30.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.30.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 30:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.30.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.30.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 30:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Musengwa Katonda waimwe aidha kubaghanga enkabi kamaala mu byonabyona bye munaakolanga. Mwidha kuzaalanga abaana kamaala, n'ensolo dhaimwe dheeyongerenga okwala, era mubazenga inho ebirime. Musengwa Katonda aliiramu kabiri okuba omusangaavu okubagha enkabi, nga bweyali omusangaavu okudhigha badhaadha baimwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.30.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.30.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 30:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye muli n'okumuwuliranga n'okutuukirizanga amateeka ge n'ebiragiro bye, ebighandiikiibwa mu kitabo kino eky'Amateeka. Era muli n'okukyuka mwaira y'ali n'omutima gwaimwe gwonagwona era n'omwoyo gwaimwe gwonagwona.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.30.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.30.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 30:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.30.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.30.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 30:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ebiragiro bino bye ndi kubagha olwaleero ti bizibu inho, era tibibaswikiriire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.30.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.30.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 30:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tibiri ku igulu, olwo mukobe muti, ‘Naani anaatuniinirayo abituleetere, memale tughange okubiwulira n'okubituukiriza.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.30.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.30.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ROM.10.6+ROM.10.7+ROM.10.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Rom 10:6-8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.30.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.30.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 30:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Era tibiri ere ng'osomoike enhandha, olwo mukobe muti, ‘Naani anaatusomokera enhandha abituleetere, memale tughange okubiwulira n'okubituukiriza?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.30.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.30.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 30:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye biri kumpi inho n'imwe. Bibali ku munwa, ni ku myoyo, olwo mughange okubituukirizanga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.30.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.30.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 30:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.30.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.30.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 30:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Bona, olwaleero ndi kubagha okulondagho okuba obulungi oba okuba obubi, okuba abalamu oba okufa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.30.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.30.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 30:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuba ndi kubalagira olwaleero okugonzanga Musengwa Katonda waimwe, n'okujiiranga ku by'abagalagira, n'okukuumanga amateeka ge n'ebiragiro bye byonabyona. Olwo mughange okubanga abalamu, muzaalenga mweyongere obungi, era Musengwa Katonda waimwe abaghenga enkabi mu nsi ye muja okutwala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.30.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.30.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 30:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye bwe munaakyukanga ni mutawulira, era ni musendebwasendebwa, ni mukuba amakiryaivu okusinza bakatonda abandi n'okubagheereza, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.30.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.30.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 30:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mbalabula olwaleero nti timuliroba kuzikirira. Timulighangaalira mu nsi ye muli kuja okutwala nga musomoike omwiga Yorudani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.30.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.30.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 30:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndayira olwaleero eigulu n'ensi bibe abadhulizi bange ababalumiriza, nti mbaghaire okulondagho okuba abalamu oba okufa, okugheebwa enkabi oba okukolimirwa. Kale ni mulondegho obulamu, mughange okubanga abalamu n'eizaire lyaimwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.30.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.30.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 30:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mugonzenga Musengwa Katonda waimwe, mumuwulirenga, era mubenga beesigwa y'ali. Kuba oyo, n'obulamu bwaimwe, era n'obughanguzi bwaimwe. Olwo mwidha kubanga mu nsi Musengwa Katonda waimwe ye yasuubiza okugha badhaadha baimwe Aburahamu, ni Isaaka, ni Yakobo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.30.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.30.20"
            ]
          }
        },
